{"storymap": {"call_to_action": true, "call_to_action_text": "Esplora!", "language": "it", "map_as_image": false, "map_type": "osm:standard", "slides": [{"date": "", "location": {"line": true}, "media": {"caption": "Foto panoramica di Gubbio", "credit": "", "url": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/a70e9be958d2b4fea727892812af91ef/a-spasso-per-gubbio-2026/_images/Screenshot_2024-05-28_183211-kq3ld8Rox-transformed.png"}, "text": {"headline": "A SPASSO PER GUBBIO", "text": "<strong>A spasso per Gubbio</strong> è la guida digitale avviata dall'ex Scuola Secondaria di Primo Grado \"Mastro Giorgio-Nelli\" e oggi mantenuta in continuo aggiornamento dall'Istituto Comprensivo Gubbio 1. Nato per accompagnare giovani turisti e cittadini alla scoperta della città, il progetto offre un percorso passo passo per svelare l'essenza del territorio e valorizzarne il patrimonio storico e artistico.&nbsp;Buona passeggiata per Gubbio!<br><br><b>A spasso per Gubbio </b>(Strolling through Gubbio) is the digital guide launched by the former \"Mastro Giorgio-Nelli\" Lower Secondary School and now kept continuously updated by the Istituto Comprensivo Gubbio 1. Created to accompany young tourists and residents in discovering the city, the project offers a step-by-step path to reveal the essence of the area and highlight its historical and artistic heritage. Enjoy your walk through Gubbio!<br><br><b>A spasso per Gubbio</b> (Paseando por Gubbio) es la guía digital creada por la antigua Escuela Secundaria de Primer Grado \"Mastro Giorgio-Nelli\" y actualizada de forma continua por el Istituto Comprensivo Gubbio 1. Nacido para acompañar a jóvenes turistas y ciudadanos en el descubrimiento de la ciudad, el proyecto ofrece un recorrido paso a paso para desvelar la esencia del territorio y valorizar su patrimonio histórico y artístico. ¡Buen paseo por Gubbio!<br><br><b>A spasso per Gubbio </b>(Se promener à Gubbio) est le guide numérique créé par l'ancien collège \"Mastro Giorgio-Nelli\" et aujourd'hui mis à jour en continu par l'Istituto Comprensivo Gubbio 1. Conçu pour accompagner les jeunes touristes et les habitants à la découverte de la ville, le projet propose un parcours pas à pas pour révéler l'essence du territoire et mettre en valeur son patrimoine historique et artistique. Bonne promenade à Gubbio !<br>"}, "type": "overview"}, {"date": "", "location": {"icon": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/cartina Gubbio.png", "iconSize": [48, 33.826771653543304], "lat": 43.351868, "line": true, "lon": 12.578854, "use_custom_marker": true, "zoom": 17}, "media": {"caption": "Cartina di Gubbio", "credit": "", "url": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/cartina Gubbio.png"}, "text": {"headline": "GUBBIO", "text": "ITALIANO<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1WeYkj6gXyPlt0JvmmCOE49H7plrFCCB5/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>ENGLISH<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-z5yaIEdiV6F5laCXGVDJmIYBF1YBg2u/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>ESPAÑOL<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/114j0m_cCiAVK4aYpbbVHdcIiExmpKkh1/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>FRANÇAIS<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JNI2hAoMTIzXGoU46aWD_WzT1kL41fe0/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>"}}, {"date": "", "location": {"icon": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/CV2.jpg", "iconSize": [48, 36], "lat": 43.34389879857397, "line": true, "lon": 12.58031129837036, "use_custom_marker": true, "zoom": 1}, "media": {"caption": "Chiesa della Vittorina", "credit": "Foto di Chiocci Zoe", "url": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/CV3.JPG"}, "text": {"headline": "CHIESA DELLA VI