e/d/1bHGUJ69KraYQqx2NkmIPPes7lcm9Rsn-/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe>"}}, {"date": "", "location": {"icon": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/porta s.lucia.png", "iconSize": [29.89117291414752, 48], "lat": 43.355322, "line": true, "lon": 12.572967, "use_custom_marker": true, "zoom": 17}, "media": {"caption": "Porta di S.Lucia", "credit": "", "url": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/porta s.lucia.png"}, "text": {"headline": "PORTA DI S.LUCIA", "text": "ITALIANO<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1jOYkHuVJyC1GQj_B8s9vZxOuTSstP2-3/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>ENGLISH<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1oFN2_Dyy80D4v-rq9A4sY38L2IXEutZ3/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>ESPAÑOL<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xKj8WqBhh9kg3sgydP5ZOr9iGuRUR2nt/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>FRANÇAIS<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Lcwj6mTYyHYGya9A8OAmeOPvK8x_ROEG/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe>"}}, {"date": "", "location": {"icon": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/porta metauro.png", "iconSize": [47.85607196401799, 48], "lat": 43.356464, "line": true, "lon": 12.575879, "use_custom_marker": true, "zoom": 17}, "media": {"caption": "Porta metauro o porta di S.Croce", "credit": "", "url": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/porta metauro.png"}, "text": {"headline": "PORTA METAURO O PORTA DI S.CROCE", "text": "ITALIANO<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1jOYkHuVJyC1GQj_B8s9vZxOuTSstP2-3/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>Detta anche di Santa Croce o Scattone, conserva l'antico portone in legno.<br><br>ENGLISH<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1oFN2_Dyy80D4v-rq9A4sY38L2IXEutZ3/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>Also known as Porta di Santa Croce or Scattone, it preserves the ancient wooden door. <br><br>ESPAÑOL<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xKj8WqBhh9kg3sgydP5ZOr9iGuRUR2nt/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>También llamada de Santa Croce o Scattone, conserva la antigua puerta de madera. <br><br>FRANÇAIS<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Lcwj6mTYyHYGya9A8OAmeOPvK8x_ROEG/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>Également appelée porte de Santa Croce ou Scattone, elle conserve l'ancienne porte en bois."}}, {"date": "", "location": {"icon": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/s.ambrogio.png", "iconSize": [48, 30.67972027972028], "lat": 43.35868276341175, "line": true, "lon": 12.576513290405273, "use_custom_marker": true, "zoom": 17}, "media": {"caption": "Eremo di S.Ambrogio", "credit": "", "url": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/s.ambrogio.png"}, "text": {"headline": "EREMO S.AMBROGIO", "text": "ITALIANO<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rpx4ANqKVIYPWIuCjS6awvvziLBy_KGq/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>ENGLISH<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1HFqf2I76-0nXJCegHFOdicDH9rk_VEZM/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>ESPAÑOL<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wQrYEarIfZwAJomjdkRNxw5z4wUMYVib/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>FRANÇAIS<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1IbfWVtqMtsWC3b2G8lIJEmaOKI0pgE9k/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe>"}}, {"date": "", "locati