ubaldo.png", "iconSize": [42.680573663624514, 48], "lat": 43.353308, "line": true, "lon": 12.582028, "use_custom_marker": true, "zoom": 17}, "media": {"caption": "", "credit": "Porta S.Ubaldo", "url": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/porta s.ubaldo.png"}, "text": {"headline": "PORTA S.UBALDO", "text": "ITALIANO<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1jOYkHuVJyC1GQj_B8s9vZxOuTSstP2-3/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>Conosciuta anche come Porta dell'Angelo.<br><br>ENGLISH<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1oFN2_Dyy80D4v-rq9A4sY38L2IXEutZ3/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>Also known as Porta dell'Angelo.<br><br>ESPAÑOL<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xKj8WqBhh9kg3sgydP5ZOr9iGuRUR2nt/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>También conocida como Porta dell'Angelo.<br><br>FRANÇAIS<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Lcwj6mTYyHYGya9A8OAmeOPvK8x_ROEG/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>&nbsp;Également connue sous le nom de Porta dell'Angelo."}}, {"date": "", "location": {"icon": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/20230606_101322.jpg", "iconSize": [36, 48], "lat": 43.3530894651377, "line": true, "lon": 12.583658695220947, "use_custom_marker": true, "zoom": 18}, "media": {"caption": "Lapide di Umberto Paruccini", "credit": "Disegno degli alunni della classe 3C a.s.2022/2023", "url": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/Screenshot 2024-04-10 213133.png"}, "text": {"headline": "UMBERTO PARUCCINI", "text": "ITALIANO<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xv4ZN84R9mSH7MVY539FivVVfJ34yTIw/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>ENGLISH<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1YTo4m8t4-TZ6pwMdqXV7MNgJDWP1etMp/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>ESPAÑOL<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1FlqH-JP8gZEiriINxisCf-RORRsFQ7e0/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>FRANÇAIS<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1qRRUFI__UZj3yMAQYQGTubmGUmvTx1k1/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe>"}}, {"date": "", "location": {"icon": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/Basilica1.jpg", "iconSize": [31.99247412982126, 48], "lat": 43.35644784623937, "line": true, "lon": 12.585021257400513, "use_custom_marker": true, "zoom": 18}, "media": {"caption": "Federico Barbarossa muove contro Gubbio anno 1154", "credit": "Foto di Chiocci Zoe", "url": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/Basilica7.jpg"}, "text": {"headline": "S. UBALDO", "text": "ITALIANO<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KF_SOfYH6vg__M5kXrrpbbJkiK1-DMJO/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>ENGLISH<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BoTLlSR9XbePAHKxjfrkCNW_bj0TqA0a/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>ESPAÑOL<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1VkpdMUsSxHfCgx0qRMnG9rWO_XTACgmd/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>FRANÇAIS<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1jlrSeOPucsDO3G3KZIzJORLuwQxbhO68/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe>"}}, {"date": "", "location": {"icon": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/porta romana.png", "iconSize": [39.90762124711316, 48], "lat": 43.34971139376229, "line": true, "lon": 12.583798170089722, "use_custom_marker": true, "zoom": 17}, "media": {"caption": "", "credit": "Porta romana o porta di S.Agostino", "url": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/porta romana.png"}, "text": {"headline": "PORTA ROMANA O PORTA DI S.AGOSTINO", "text": "ITALIANO<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1jOYkHuVJyC1GQj_B8s9vZxOuTSstP2-3/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>Porta civica tardo-duecentesca. E' l'unica tra quelle eugubine che si è conservata completa del torrione e del vano per alloggiare la saracinesca. Sulla fronte campeggia un antico stemma della città. Sotto l'arco, nel lato interno, sono visibili tracce di un affresco con la Madonna e Santi.<br><br>ENGLISH<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1oFN2_Dyy80D4v-rq9A4sY38L2IXEutZ3/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>Late 13th-century city gate. It is the only one among Gubbio's gates to have been preserved complete with its tower and the housing for the portcullis. An ancient coat of arms of the city stands out on the front. Under the arch, on the inner side, traces of a fresco depicting the Madonna and Saints are visible.<br><br>ESPAÑOL<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xKj8WqBhh9kg3sgydP5ZOr9iGuRUR2nt/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>Puerta cívica de finales del siglo XIII. Es la única entre las de Gubbio que se ha conservado completa, con su torreón y el hueco destinado a alojar el rastrillo. En la fachada destaca un antiguo escudo de la ciudad. Bajo el arco, en el lado interior, son visibles restos de un fresco con la Virgen y Santos<br><br>FRANÇAIS<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Lcwj6mTYyHYGya9A8OAmeOPvK8x_ROEG/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>Porte urbaine de la fin du XIIIe siècle. C'est la seule parmi celles de Gubbio à avoir été conservée intacte, avec sa tour et le logement destiné à la herse. Sur la façade se détache un ancien blason de la ville. Sous l'arche, côté intérieur, on peut apercevoir des traces d'une fresque représentant la Madone et des Saints."}}, {"date": "", "location": {"icon": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/s.agostino.jpg", "iconSize": [38.43824701195219, 48], "lat": 43.349551457315016, "line": true, "lon": 12.584216594696043, "use_custom_marker": true, "zoom": 18}, "media": {"caption": "Riproduzione di un affresco all'interno della chiesa di Sant'Agostino attribuito a Ottaviano Nelli", "credit": "", "url": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/Ottaviano Nelli Sant'Agostino.jpg"}, "text": {"headline": "CHIESA DI SANT'AGOSTINO", "text": "ITALIANO<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Ps2wuZK3r1RMP87wBsZ9gaqXlAxSk3TM/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>ENGLISH<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-UaAfPSgv7GOyLW33286JUFv8sGQdXms/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>ESPAÑOL<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1XuuHiUDjynEjUBF2vL5i6ZbWRa6ESnzz/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>FRANÇAIS<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10coLw0-2N1Ek_eZj0qRnZ_BPluXgBgIC/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe>"}}, {"date": "", "location": {"icon": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/porta s. pietro.png", "iconSize": [37.010339734121125, 48], "lat": 43.34891, "line": true, "lon": 12.579675, "use_custom_marker": true, "zoom": 17}, "media": {"caption": "", "credit": "Porta S.Pietro", "url": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/porta s. pietro.png"}, "text": {"headline": "PORTA S. PIETRO", "text": "ITALIANO<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1jOYkHuVJyC1GQj_B8s9vZxOuTSstP2-3/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>ENGLISH<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1oFN2_Dyy80D4v-rq9A4sY38L2IXEutZ3/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>ESPAÑOL<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xKj8WqBhh9kg3sgydP5ZOr9iGuRUR2nt/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>FRANÇAIS<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Lcwj6mTYyHYGya9A8OAmeOPvK8x_ROEG/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe>"}}, {"date": "", "location": {"icon": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/viale rimembranza.jpeg", "iconSize": [35.95366795366795, 48], "lat": 43.34776092051458, "line": true, "lon": 12.581196427345276, "use_custom_marker": true, "zoom": 18}, "media": {"caption": "Viale della Rimembranza", "credit": "", "url": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/viale rimembranza.jpeg"}, "text": {"headline": "VIALE DELLA RIMEMBRANZA", "text": "ITALIANO<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1yeQWC3_d2AFW3jeG1TK62fEwinyOYXS_/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>ENGLISH<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1AwZ4AcHvwzZS3DQIhJBI7kSlSyeSCtc1/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>ESPAÑOL<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zvtTphWurcBuj4e5lhFeQbP25SeP_-RM/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe><br>FRANÇAIS<br><iframe src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1_d6V6DemiXLtMM9SRIf2_Fh71LrjFBKG/preview\" width=\"320\" height=\"50\" allow=\"autoplay\"></iframe>"}}, {"date": "", "location": {"icon": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/viale rimembranza.jpeg", "iconSize": [35.95366795366795, 48], "lat": 43.34776092051458, "line": true, "lon": 12.581196427345276, "use_custom_marker": true, "zoom": 18}, "media": {"caption": "Istituto Comprensivo Gubbio 1", "credit": "", "url": "//uploads.knightlab.com/storymapjs/9f5d3bf1c34a305226fbf917c34ca4fa/a-spasso-per-gubbio/_images/scuola.png"}, "text": {"headline": "Grazie per l'attenzione!", "text": "<em><strong>Ringraziamenti</strong><br>Ringraziamo vivamente i docenti e le classi che si sono \"spese sul campo\" per reperire e fornire informazioni sui siti e monumenti indagati, permettendoci di formulare una prima mappatura della nostra bella città e del suo territorio.&nbsp;<br></em><strong>Nota sui contenuti audio</strong><br>Alcune tracce audio di questo progetto sono state generate con il supporto dell'Intelligenza Artificiale. Ci scusiamo fin d'ora per eventuali imperfezioni o piccoli errori di pronuncia presenti nelle narrazioni."}}]}}
